---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/page-layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site.config';
---

<PageLayout lang="en" title="About" description="About the author">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose prose-lg">
    <p class="lead">
      I'm a frontend engineer at <strong>Toss Bank</strong>, working on compliance products since
      January 2024.
    </p>

    <p>
      I build customer-facing experiences and internal tools for compliance operations serving both
      individual and corporate customers.
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Customer-facing:</strong> KYC (customer due diligence) and FATCA/CRS (tax residency
        self-certification).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Back-office:</strong> KYC reviews, end-to-end FATCA/CRS operations (reviews,
        regulatory reporting, and ongoing submissions), AML, STR/CTR (transaction reporting), and
        watchlist screening.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Frontend engineering:</strong> Performance optimization, shared UI architecture,
        monorepo tooling, and developer experience.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <blockquote>
      <p>
        I enjoy making complex domain logic easier to understand and maintain, without losing the
        details that matter.
      </p>
    </blockquote>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href={SITE.links.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/%EA%B0%80%EB%A6%BD-%EC%9C%A4-51a23b235/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
